# A token is a creature too: on turn 4 Bot2 bolts one of the three Rabbit tokens Hop to It made for Bot1, and Aang, at the
# Crossroads triggers for it ("another creature you control leaves the battlefield"). The token ceases to exist (CR 111.7)
# and is in no graveyard; at the next upkeep, Bot1's on turn 5, Aang becomes Aang, Destined Savior. "Land creatures you
# control have vigilance" is Bot1's alone: on turn 6 Bot2's Badgermole Cub earthbends Bot2's Mountain, which attacks with
# haste and taps - no vigilance from Bot1's Aang.

